Receipt 01 — The Adobe Compromise

Claim: Mr. Raccoon compromised Adobe-associated systems.

Origin: Threat actor.

Independent Evidence: Cybersecurity reporting confirms that the allegation was made.

Adobe Confirmation: None located as of the current review.

InfinityGrid Grade

CLAIMED

Reporting that a claim exists proves the claim was made.

It does not prove the underlying breach occurred.

Receipt 02 — 13 Million Support Tickets

Claim: Approximately 13 million Adobe support tickets were obtained.

InfinityGrid Grade

UNVERIFIED

Until stronger evidence emerges, use:

"Approximately 13 million support tickets claimed."

Do not use:

"13 million Adobe customers were breached."

Those statements are not equivalent.

