Receipt 04 — HackerOne Data

Claim: Adobe-related HackerOne vulnerability submissions were obtained.

InfinityGrid Grade

UNVERIFIED / HIGH CONSEQUENCE

This claim receives elevated monitoring because successful theft of private vulnerability reports could create downstream exploitation risk.

Impact does not increase evidence confidence.

A serious allegation still requires proof.

Receipt 05 — BPO Attack Method

Claim: Attackers compromised a third-party BPO employee and used trusted access to reach Adobe-associated systems.

InfinityGrid Grade

PLAUSIBLE / PARTLY CORROBORATED PATTERN

Independent threat intelligence establishes that attackers were targeting BPO/helpdesk environments using related techniques.

That corroborates the attack pattern.

It does not independently corroborate the Adobe victim claim.

Receipt 06 — Adobe Confirmation

